--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data and components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Princeton WordNet 3.0 (https://wordnet.princeton.edu/)
    Used at build time to generate English definitions (data-enrich.js) and
    derivational relations. The raw WordNet database is NOT distributed with
    this repository. WordNet is distributed under the Princeton WordNet
    License, which permits use, copying, modification and distribution
    provided the copyright notice and license are retained.

Open Multilingual WordNet (https://omwn.org/, omw-2.0)
    Used at build time for Chinese lemma alignment. Each language sub-wordnet
    is governed by its own upstream license.

NLTK corpora (https://www.nltk.org/nltk_data/)
    Used at build time to compute collocation statistics (PMI over sentence
    windows). The corpora are NOT distributed with this repository.
      - Brown Corpus, Gutenberg Corpus ... freely usable / public domain
      - Reuters Corpus, movie_reviews ... RESEARCH USE ONLY
    Collocation data in data-enrich.js is a derived statistical product of
    these corpora. If you intend COMMERCIAL redistribution, regenerate the
    collocation data from public-domain or permissively licensed corpora.

Android signing keystore
    The APK in release/ is signed with a locally held self-signed keystore.
    The keystore file and its password are NOT part of this repository.
